                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a fairly generic top-down survival shooter. There's not a whole lot of variety when it comes to the enemies, and they all feel fairly uninspired. There's a little more variety in the weapon selection, but again, nothing that really stands out. The game can be enjoyable for a couple of hours, especially if you can play co-op with someone, but there's nothing here that gives you much reason to keep coming back.",
